  "question": {
    "text": "A line charge of length $\\frac{\\text { ' } a \\text { ' }}{2}$ is kept at the center of an edge $B C$ of a cube $A B C D E F G H$ having edge length ' $a$ ' as shown in the figure. If the density of line charge is $\\lambda$ C per unit length, then the total electric flux through all the faces of the cube will be _______. (Take, $\\epsilon_0$ as the free space permittivity)\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6HF-S8bPwsVcewf1PqlxFbmeC_3QJVG0zoDF8MwnrEg.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HuED7",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\lambda \\mathrm{a}}{2 \\epsilon_0}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ms2yL",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\lambda \\mathrm{a}}{4 \\epsilon_0}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nSUNG",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\lambda \\mathrm{a}}{16 \\epsilon_0}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "7JvZf",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\lambda \\mathrm{a}}{8 \\epsilon_0}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Charge of the line charge }=\\frac{a \\lambda}{2} \\\\ & \\text { Portion of wire inside cube }=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ & \\therefore \\quad q_{e n}=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{a \\lambda}{2}\\right)=\\frac{a \\lambda}{8} \\\\ & \\qquad \\phi=\\frac{q_{e n}}{\\varepsilon_0}=\\frac{a \\lambda}{8 \\varepsilon_0}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
